386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 342 0 R
/E (Raw solar generation data alone does not reveal whether output is normal or abnormally low. Manual monitoring fails to catch persistent underperformance, hinders cross-site comparison and prioritization, and provides no insight into potential energy loss.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 342 0 R
/E (The Solution)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 342 0 R
/E (SolarPulse combines MySQL \(structured storage\), Python + Pandas \(cleaning and feature engineering\), Machine Learning \(expected generation prediction\), performance analysis \(actual vs expected\), Power BI \(interactive monitoring\), and Streamlit \(interactive prediction app\) into one end-to-end pipeline.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
